 HALT:,NAME,
C===========================================================
C halt() - terminate the program through the Pascal runtime.
C
C Calling convention for a zero-argument ASSEMBLER routine:
C   M13 = return link
C
C P/HT does not return normally.  Tail-call it so it receives the caller's
C link and the current activation chain unchanged.
C===========================================================
 P/HT:          ,SUBP,
                ,UJ  ,P/HT
                ,END ,
